      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Misinformation",
      "label": "Misinformation",
      "description": "False or inaccurate information that is spread, often unintentionally, without the intent to deceive. In the context of AI face-swapping technology, misinformation can be generated when manipulated images are shared as authentic, leading to confusion, harm, or damage to reputations. The meme implies that such technology can be used to create misleading content.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
