      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_3fca9673",
      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "The text 'this faceapp stuff is incredible!' is mapped onto the visual entity of the woman expressing amazement.",
      "description": "The text 'this faceapp stuff is incredible!' is overlaid on the image of the woman, who is depicted with an expression of amazement or wonder. This creates an analogical mapping where the woman's emotional state (amazement) is being projected as the reaction to the FaceApp technology mentioned in the text. The woman visually represents the 'user' or 'observer' who is amazed by the capabilities of FaceApp, which is the subject of the text.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
