      "description": "The text 'this faceapp stuff is incredible!' is juxtaposed with the image of Osama bin Laden, implying that the AI technology (FaceApp) is capable of generating such an image. This creates an analogical mapping where the image of Osama bin Laden is being presented as a result or example of the 'incredible' capabilities of FaceApp. The visual entity (Osama bin Laden) is mapped onto the textual claim that the technology can produce 'incredible' results, even if those results are absurd or inappropriate.",
